@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Graderate

state "Waiting" as Waiting
state "Active" as Active
state "Expired" as Expired
state "Archived" as Archived

[*] --> Waiting

Waiting : entry/waiting state
Waiting : do/wait for start date
Waiting : exit/start date arrived

Waiting --> Active

Active : entry/active state
Active : do/maintain active state
Active : exit/end of validity period

Active --> Expired

Expired : entry/expired state
Expired : do/mark rate as expired
Expired : exit/one year from expiration date

Expired --> Archived

Archived : entry/archived state
Archived : do/remove or archive rate
Archived --> [*]

@enduml
